-- backend/supabase/migrations/20261111000000_drinks_more.sql
--
-- MORE DRINKS, MORE SPECIFIC. Doubles the curated set to 66: cocktails by
-- spirit (gin, vodka, rum, tequila, whiskey, wine & bubbles, warm), and
-- mocktails by kind (smoothies & shakes, coffee & tea, lemonades & sodas,
-- juices, warm & cozy, pitchers & punch). Idempotent upsert of the whole
-- set; the app de-duplicates imported drinks by name (utils/drinks.ts),
-- so one Egg Nog, not seven. Generated by the drinks generator — edit
-- its data, not this file.

